    "body": "> Because I noticed the build script was changing it anyway. But I guess it should not be.\r\n\r\nWow, that sounds magical. I wonder where that happens.\r\n\r\n> The rationale is that these elements can be used as children of the template element, separated from the context of table tree, and in that different template context they never have implicit end tags as far as the parsing behavior/algorithm goes.\r\n\r\nBut maybe they should? Seems annoying to have to write them differently there.",
